OL,3,GNEWSA'A Victorian woman living ahead of
OL,4,Aher time'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the world's first professional
OL,7,Ffemale journalists deserves far greater
OL,8,Frecognition, especially in her home
OL,9,Ftown of Norwich, according to a
OL,10,Fhistorian.
OL,12,FHarriet Martineau was one of the most
OL,13,Fprolific and famous writers of the 19th
OL,14,FCentury, writing dozens of books and at
OL,15,Fleast 1,500 newspaper articles.
OL,17,FStuart Hobday said she also campaigned
OL,18,Fagainst slavery and for women's rights
OL,19,Fand also championed a scientific,
OL,20,Fevidence-based approach to the world
OL,21,Ftaken for granted today.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
