OL,3,GNEWSA'A Victorian woman living ahead of
OL,4,Aher time'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of Norwich History
OL,7,FFestival said she remained
OL,8,Findependently-minded all her life,
OL,9,Fdescribing her as "a Victorian living
OL,10,Fahead of her time".
